cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness, please cite the InnovatorVL-v2 report and this software as below."
title: "InnovatorVL-v2 Eval Harness"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "InnovatorVL-v2 Team"
license: MIT
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
url: "https://github.com/turturturturtur/InnovatorVL-v2-eval-harness"
repository-code: "https://github.com/turturturturtur/InnovatorVL-v2-eval-harness"
keywords:
  - multimodal evaluation
  - vision language models
  - benchmark
  - llm-as-a-judge
  - evaluation harness
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  The evaluation harness used to produce the benchmark numbers reported for
  InnovatorVL-v2. Derived from LMMs-Eval (MIT License), it adds an
  LLM-as-a-judge pipeline, a web console for launching and inspecting runs,
  Alibaba Cloud PAI-DLC cluster submission, a storage and runtime contract, and
  task- and backend-level correctness fixes.
